  "problem": "Given the graph of $y=f(x),$ we apply the following transformations in the order given:\n\n1\\. Translate it up by $7$ units\n\n2\\. Stretch it by a scale factor of $3$ parallel to the $y$-axis\n\n3\\. Stretch it by a scale factor of $2$ parallel to the $x$-axis\n\nWhat is the final function expression after applying all the transformations?",
